## Messages displayed as the result of Web Console commands.

# Displayed when a string is copied to the clipboard with the copy() command,
# for example copy({hello: "world"}).
webconsole-commands-copy-value-to-clipboard = තන්තුව පසුරු පුවරුවට පිටපත් විය.
# Displayed when no filter is passed to the :block or :unblock commands.
webconsole-commands-block-arg-missing = පෙරහනක් සඳහන් කර නැත
